    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1">

                <pb facs="0101" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg1"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.5294/310</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chief of the Division of Far Eastern Affairs,
                        Department of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Ambassador in
                        Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morris</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">temporarily in the United
                        States</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-06-16"><hi rendition="#italic">June 16,
                        1920</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi></p>
                <p>In accordance with your request of yesterday, I took occasion when consulting
                    with the Secretary about the California question, last night, to inquire of him
                    when and how he had presented to the Cabinet the question raised by the
                    California Initiative Petition. He said that he brought up the subject just
                    three weeks ago (May 25th). In reply to a further question, he said that he had
                    presented the matter on the basis of a memorandum which I had prepared by his
                    direction at that time.</p>
                <p>This evidently refers to the attached memorandum epitomizing the essential points
                    of the initiative proposal.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacM</hi>[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >urray</hi>]</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d1-a1.xml" xpointer="d1-a1"/>
            </div>
